                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of licensing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f32ae48-b300-45ab-9dae-001d4ea10bf9",
                                                "sense_id": "d076b7a2-1d2f-3cd3-b1c5-d470f448bfd9",
                                                "text": "For who knows not that Truth is strong next to the Almighty; she needs no policies, no strategems, no licencings to make her victorious, those are the shifts and the defences that error uses against her power: give her but room, and do not bind her when she sleeps […]"
